# An adjective standing BEFORE its noun -- Georgian is postpositional in its
# adposition system, not in its modifiers.  The dative/adverbial form მომავალ
# is the one a case-marked noun takes: "მომავალ წელს" == next year.
# en.wiktionary.org, მომავალი, sense "next" with that example --
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/%E1%83%9B%E1%83%9D%E1%83%9B%E1%83%90%E1%83%95%E1%83%90%E1%83%9A%E1%83%98
მომავალი
მომავალ
